\pard \b\fs36\cf1 Exit Survey Mode
\par \plain\fs24 On leaving \uldb \b Survey Mode State\plain\b\fs24 {\v Survey_Mode_State}\plain\fs24  the Magnification, Working Distance, 
\par Brightness and Stage Z are restored to the values which existed when 
\par \uldb \b Survey Mode\plain\b\fs24 {\v Survey_Overview}\plain\fs24  was switched On.
\par 
\par If selected the Exit Survey Mode Macro will be executed when the stage 
\par movement is completed.
\par 
\par See \uldb \b Stage Manager Survey tab\plain\b\fs24 {\v StgMgr_Survey}\plain\fs24 
\par \page
