{\up $}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up $} Resolution Mode Macro}
{\up #}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up #} Resolution_Mode_Macro}
{\up >}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up >} main}
\pard \b\fs36\cf1 Resolution Mode Macro
\par \plain\fs24 The Drop Down Combo Box offers a choice of all the currently available macros.
\par 
\par Select a macro from the list and check the checkbox if you wish this macro to be executed on entering \uldb \b Resolution Mode State\plain\b\fs24 {\v Resolution_Mode_State}\plain\fs24  (i.e. Performing Centre Point or Centre Feature while in \uldb \b survey mode state\plain\b\fs24 {\v Survey_Mode_State}\plain\fs24  mode).
\par 
\par The macro will be executed when the Auto Focus finishes, unless Auto Focus is not selected, in which case it is executed when the Stage motion is completed.
\par \page
